    &lt;/div>
 &lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Sam</title><link>https://DaniloHorn.github.io/sam/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://DaniloHorn.github.io/sam/</guid><description>&lt;div class="centered-content single-flex" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255);">







 
 
 
 

 
 
 
 

 
 
 
 

 
 
 
 

 
 
 
 



 

